# Reset an in-progress transaction and successfully send an email.
< 220
> EHLO localhost
< 250
> MAIL FROM:<me@test.com>
< 250
> RCPT TO:<you@test.com>
< 250
> RSET
< 250
> MAIL FROM:<me@test.com>
< 250
> RCPT TO:<you@test.com>
< 250
> DATA
< 354
> From: me@test.com
> To: you@test.com
> Subject: A Test Email
>
> Hello!
> .
< 250
> QUIT
< 221